codex
The overlap tests pass, including exclusive execution for the TTS adapter. One legacy assertion assumed sibling adapters were invoked sequentially; that is no longer a valid invariant once branches overlap, so I’m updating it to assert the stable reported topological order and the dependency boundaries instead. I’m also removing the now-obsolete sequential implementation before the full regression run.
